/* ── Element spec ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   glass tube      → CylinderGeometry(0.28,0.28,4.6, open) MeshPhysicalMaterial transmission
   tube bottom     → SphereGeometry hemisphere r .28   ·  tube top → CylinderGeometry(0.33,0.28,0.25)
   sample column   → CylinderGeometry(0.2,0.2,2.6)  #E8A33D emissive flash
   highlight stripe→ CylinderGeometry(0.205,0.205,2.5, thetaLength .7) #F5C77E
   coil            → TubeGeometry(helix 22 turns r .42, y -1.1..0.9) #4CAF3E
   collars (2)     → CylinderGeometry(0.48,0.48,0.25) #1E6FB8 at y=+1.0, -1.2
   magnets (2)     → CylinderGeometry(0.95,0.95,1.9) axis X, metal + rim torus + S/N canvas decal
   generator       → Box(3.0,1.1,1.6) beige + sloped panel + LCD plane + 2 knobs + button rows
   detector        → Box(1.3,2.0,1.4) #3A3F44 + bezel + 2 dials + silver knob + green/red buttons
   monitor         → bezel Box(3.0,2.1,0.12) + screen plane 2.6x1.7 CanvasTexture + neck + oval base
   cables          → CatmullRomCurve3 → TubeGeometry r .045 (2 green, 2 blue low, 2 blue high)
   leader line     → Line  black thin  (label 'Sample in tube')
